    <!-- Win98 tab edges: 1px white top and left, 1px #808080 right, then 1px black outside
         that. The bevel pair draws the white and the #808080; the outline Border draws the
         black in the tab's own 1px right border column. Every margin reaches the tab's foot
         so the side lines run down to the page line as they do in the real control. -->
